# Third-party asset notices

The project modifies third-party 3D models for browser rendering. The
original creators and licenses are listed below. Product names and trademarks
belong to their respective owners; those companies do not sponsor or endorse
this project.

## Iphone 17 pro

- Creator: [Ibrahim.Bhl](https://sketchfab.com/Ibrahim.Bhl)
- Source: [Sketchfab model](https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/iphone-17-pro-4aeeeb41f9d14f96bb3f2589edc3edac)
- License: [Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/)
- Changes: converted and prepared for browser rendering; screen material and
  transform metadata are supplied by this project.

## Phone 17 Pro Max

- Creator: [Ranguel](https://sketchfab.com/Ranguel)
- Source: [Sketchfab model](https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/phone-17-pro-max-66809964eff043a39d553c3795995008)
- License: [Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/)
- Changes: optimized with glTF-Transform for browser delivery; corrective
