# P0 offline rendering additions (2026-10-29)

The original notices below are retained. The following additional runtime resources are bundled so model loading and lighting do not require a CDN:

- `public/draco/`: the unchanged glTF Draco decoder from `three@0.185.1`, Draco under Apache-2.0 (`public/draco/DRACO-LICENSE.txt`); the Three.js MIT notice is retained in `public/draco/THREE-LICENSE.txt`. Source: https://github.com/google/draco .
- `public/environments/`: the four original drei HDRI preset assets, from Poly Haven under CC0. Asset pages, exact pinned download URLs and checksums are recorded in that directory. Primary license: https://polyhaven.com/license .

No original phone GLB, recording, reference video, license or attribution file was removed.

